      "writtenOn": "2023-08-15T21:36:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We don\u0027t run them from the C++ side, since that wouldn\u0027t test any of the vendor\u0027s code or GPU at all. It would be testing SkQP\u0027s unchanged copy of Skia running against our unchanged error-test files. Error checking doesn\u0027t use the GPU or drivers so there\u0027s nothing external being tested there.\n\nInstead, what we do is we run the error test files using the Java RuntimeShader APIs. This ensures that we test the device\u0027s installed version of Skia against our error-test files.\n\nhttps://osscs.corp.google.com/skia/skia/+/main:platform_tools/android/apps/skqp/src/main/java/org/skia/skqp/SkQPRunner.java;l\u003d164;drc\u003d872be7ec539c827937513b8869f00d68b16a3727",
      "parentUuid": "51dabfc8_ffeb50bf",
